[46.5994, "o", "\r\n  host_error: this server answers only to a loopback host\r\n  cross_origin_status: 403\r\n  origin_error: cross-origin request from http://evil.example refused\r\n\r\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\nsummary\r\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\r\n  A · the brief, typed into the console            built=['app.js', 'index.html', 'styles.css', 'weather.js']\r\n  B · `start the run` is not `add to the brief`    after_first=1\r\n  C · an agent that cycles, and the cap that stops it state=stopped\r\n  D · a request with no operator token             shell_status=200\r\n  E · a Host header that is not loopback           bad_host_status=403\r\n"]
